WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.967 --> 00:00:03.136
- HEY, HEY, COME ON.
GOOD GAME. SLAP-ASS, MAN.

00:00:03.169 --> 00:00:04.904
SLAP-ASS!

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:08.574
SLAP-ASS!
SLAP-ASS!

00:00:08.607 --> 00:00:11.044
WHOO!
HEY, GARCIA.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.746
- GET HIM UP OUT OF HERE!
GET OUT OF THE LOCKER ROOM!

00:00:13.779 --> 00:00:16.482
YOU GET OUT OF THE LOCKER ROOM.
AHORA!

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:20.253
- AHH, SLAP-ASS, SLAP-ASS,
SLAP-ASS, SLAP-ASS, SLAP-ASS.

00:00:23.756 --> 00:00:25.925
- WHOO.
- GOOD GAME, GUYS, WAY TO GO.

00:00:25.958 --> 00:00:27.360
- GOOD HIT, GARCIA.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:29.562
- HEY! OH, YOU DON'T--HEY, HEY,
HEY, HEY, KNOCK IT OFF.

00:00:29.595 --> 00:00:32.098
YOU CAN'T DO THAT.
GUYS, GUYS, GUYS.

00:00:32.131 --> 00:00:33.433
PLEASE KNOW,

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:38.004
RAFI JUST GOT OUT OF TREATMENT,
REMEMBER?

00:00:38.037 --> 00:00:42.275
WE DON'T WANT TO TRIGGER HIM
WITH ANY SLAP-ASS.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.409
- HEY!

00:00:43.442 --> 00:00:46.279
WHAT THE [bleep]
IS GOING ON HERE?

00:00:46.312 --> 00:00:49.315
WHY WE ALL ACTING
LIKE THE FUNERAL IN HERE?

00:00:49.348 --> 00:00:51.250
- NO, NOTHING, RAFI, HEH.

00:00:51.283 --> 00:00:53.719
YOU JUST CAUGHT US IN THE LULL
IN THE CONVERSATION, MAN.

00:00:53.752 --> 00:00:55.922
WE'RE HAPPY.
all: YEAH!

00:00:55.955 --> 00:00:57.457
- YAY!
- WE'RE HAPPY HERE.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:58.958
- I WAS A LITTLE AFRAID
FOR A SECOND,

00:00:58.991 --> 00:01:00.626
'CAUSE, I MEAN,
THAT WAS A GOOD GAME, HUH?

00:01:00.659 --> 00:01:01.794
GOOD GAME.
- YEAH, GOOD GAME.

00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:06.065
- ALL RIGHT.
HEY, GOOD GAME.

00:01:06.098 --> 00:01:08.101
GOOD GAME, MAN.

00:01:12.104 --> 00:01:13.606
GOOD GAME.

00:01:16.976 --> 00:01:18.545
OKAY.

00:01:20.546 --> 00:01:24.150
THERE'S A<i> ELEFANTE</i> IN THE ROOM.

00:01:24.183 --> 00:01:28.387
YOU KNOW,
I WANT TO TALK ABOUT IT.

00:01:28.420 --> 00:01:31.891
SI, I HAD A PROBLEM.

00:01:31.924 --> 00:01:34.193
IT WAS BAD.

00:01:34.226 --> 00:01:35.995
AT MY LOWEST POINT,

00:01:36.028 --> 00:01:39.866
I WOULD SNEAK
INTO A HORSE'S STABLE.

00:01:39.899 --> 00:01:42.335
WHEN YOU FIND YOURSELF
AT 1:00 A.M. IN THE MORNING

00:01:42.368 --> 00:01:44.604
WITH YOUR HAND IN THE AIR

00:01:44.637 --> 00:01:46.038
AND A HORSE'S ASS

00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:47.373
IN FRONT OF YOUR FACE,

00:01:47.406 --> 00:01:49.942
THAT'S WHEN YOU KNOW IT'S BAD.

00:01:49.975 --> 00:01:51.244
- OH, RAFI.

00:01:51.277 --> 00:01:53.513
- BUT I'M OKAY NOW.

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.681
I'M ALL BETTER, GUYS, HONESTLY.

00:01:55.714 --> 00:01:58.551
JUST TREAT ME
LIKE I'M NORMAL, OKAY?

00:01:58.584 --> 00:02:00.653
- OKAY, RAFI.
- LET'S HAVE SOME FUN.

00:02:00.686 --> 00:02:02.221
- OKAY, RAFI.
- IT'S A GAME.

00:02:02.254 --> 00:02:03.656
IT'S BASEBALL.
- HEY, ALL RIGHT.

00:02:03.689 --> 00:02:05.224
- HERE, HERE.

00:02:05.257 --> 00:02:07.260
- GOOD [bleep] GAME.
- IT'S A GOOD GAME.

00:02:19.271 --> 00:02:21.240
- GARCIA,

00:02:21.273 --> 00:02:25.278
YOU CAN PICK UP
YOUR GLOVE.

00:02:25.311 --> 00:02:28.314
[whispering]
COME ON, PICK UP YOUR GLOVE.

00:02:44.230 --> 00:02:45.331
[laughs]

00:02:45.364 --> 00:02:47.833
HEY, WHAT I TOLD YOU, HUH?

00:02:47.866 --> 00:02:49.602
IT'S JUST NORMAL, GUYS.
COME ON.

00:02:49.635 --> 00:02:51.804
YOU SEE, I'M FINE.
I'M ALL BETTER NOW.

00:02:51.837 --> 00:02:53.372
YOU GUYS CAN DO
THE NORMAL STUFF.

00:02:53.405 --> 00:02:55.641
BE YOURSELVES.
BEND THINGS OVER.

00:02:55.674 --> 00:02:56.776
PICK THINGS UP.

00:02:56.809 --> 00:02:59.078
YOU KNOW, DO YOUR STRETCHES.

00:02:59.111 --> 00:03:02.715
TOUCH YOUR TOES,
YOU STUPID [bleep]ERS.

00:03:05.351 --> 00:03:08.454
- [whistles]
EXCUSE, POR FAVOR.

00:03:08.487 --> 00:03:10.022
HOLA, AMIGOS.

00:03:10.055 --> 00:03:13.125
- HOLA.
- MY NAME IS RUBEN.

00:03:13.158 --> 00:03:17.630
I JUST CAME OVER
FROM THE BRAVES' FARM TEAM.

00:03:17.663 --> 00:03:19.165
I'M FROM THE DOMINICAN REPUBLIC.

00:03:19.198 --> 00:03:20.266
- HEY.
- OH.

00:03:20.299 --> 00:03:21.867
- WE'RE ALL FROM
THE DOMINICAN REPUBLIC.

00:03:21.900 --> 00:03:23.069
- YEAH.
- I'M REALLY EXCITED

00:03:23.102 --> 00:03:25.304
TO BE WORKING
AND PLAYING WITH YOU ALL.

00:03:25.337 --> 00:03:26.806
GO, RHINOS.
all: GO, RHINOS.

00:03:26.839 --> 00:03:27.840
- ALL RIGHT.
- GO, RHINOS!

00:03:27.873 --> 00:03:29.542
- ALL RIGHT.
- WHOO.

00:03:29.575 --> 00:03:31.611
- THAT'S THE KIND OF SPIRIT
I LIKE TO SEE THERE, RUBEN.

00:03:31.644 --> 00:03:33.212
ALL RIGHT,
WELCOME TO THE SQUAD, MAN.

00:03:33.245 --> 00:03:34.947
- THANK YOU.
- IT'S GOOD TO SEE ANOTHER--

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:37.717
- ALL RIGHT.
MUY BUENO.

00:03:37.750 --> 00:03:39.118
ALL RIGHT.

00:03:39.151 --> 00:03:41.354
- WE GONNA NEED A BIGGER BOAT.

00:03:41.387 --> 00:03:43.956
- WHOO.

00:03:43.989 --> 00:03:45.858
- OH, THEY, UH...

00:03:45.891 --> 00:03:49.061
REALLY PUT YOUR LOCKER
RIGHT NEXT TO MY LOCKER, HUH?

00:03:49.094 --> 00:03:51.364
- I GUESS SO.

00:03:51.397 --> 00:03:53.566
- YEAH, YEAH.
- YOU GOT THIS, MAN.

00:03:53.599 --> 00:03:55.534
- YOU'RE JUST
SPENDING AN AWFUL LOT

00:03:55.567 --> 00:03:57.203
