00:03:57.236 --> 00:03:58.738 line:92%
- HEY, I HAVE A LOT OF STUFF.

00:03:58.771 --> 00:03:59.739
- YEAH.
- A LOT.

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:01.240
- I SEE THAT.

00:04:01.273 --> 00:04:02.541
- RAFI, YOU CAN DO THIS.

00:04:02.574 --> 00:04:05.077
- OH, MY GOODNESS.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:07.113
- YOU OKAY THERE, BUDDY?

00:04:07.146 --> 00:04:10.516
YOU'RE NOT LOOKING TOO GOOD.

00:04:10.549 --> 00:04:12.718
- I AM FEELING
A LITTLE BIT FLUSHED.

00:04:12.751 --> 00:04:15.755
- YOU KNOW,
I GOT A GOOD FEELING ABOUT YOU.

00:04:15.788 --> 00:04:20.326
MAYBE WE COULD BE GOOD FRIENDS,
MAYBE EVEN THE BEST OF FRIENDS.

00:04:20.359 --> 00:04:22.862
- MAYBE ANOTHER TIME.

00:04:22.895 --> 00:04:25.298
ANOTHER PLACE.

00:04:25.331 --> 00:04:27.700
BUT NOT HERE.

00:04:27.733 --> 00:04:29.602
NOT NOW.

00:04:29.635 --> 00:04:30.870
- WELL, EITHER WAY,

00:04:30.903 --> 00:04:32.004
WE'RE TEAMMATES,

00:04:32.037 --> 00:04:35.808
AND SO,
ANYTHING I CAN DO FOR YOU,

00:04:35.841 --> 00:04:36.876
ASK AWAY.

00:04:36.909 --> 00:04:37.910
- GOT IT.
- EH.

00:04:37.943 --> 00:04:38.911
- OKAY.
- GO, RHINOS!

00:04:38.944 --> 00:04:40.046
- OKAY.
- YEAH!

00:04:40.079 --> 00:04:41.881
UH!

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:43.583
- OH, NO.

00:04:49.722 --> 00:04:51.157 line:92%
