00:04:51.190 --> 00:04:52.325
- SLAP-ASS!
- RAFI, NO!

00:04:52.358 --> 00:04:54.226
- I WANT TO SLAP-ASS!
I WANT TO SLAP IT!

00:04:54.259 --> 00:04:56.295
- NO, YOU CANNOT PLAY SLAP-ASS.
- YES, I WANT TO SLAP IT.

00:04:56.328 --> 00:04:57.396
- YOU CANNOT PLAY SLAP-ASS.

00:04:57.429 --> 00:04:58.731
- YOU CAN'T
KEEP ME FROM SLAP-ASS.

00:04:58.764 --> 00:05:00.733
