- I NEED TO SLAP IT.

00:05:00.766 --> 00:05:02.802
- YOU CANNOT HAVE THE SLAP-ASS!
- YES, YES, I CAN HAVE IT.

00:05:02.835 --> 00:05:03.903
- NO SLAP-ASS.
NO SLAP-ASS.

00:05:03.936 --> 00:05:05.004
- YES, SLAP-ASS.

00:05:05.037 --> 00:05:06.339
- NO SLAP-ASS.
- SLAP-ASS--

00:05:06.372 --> 00:05:07.673
- NO SLAP-ASS.

00:05:07.706 --> 00:05:09.008
both: NO SLAP-ASS.

00:05:09.041 --> 00:05:10.076
- THAT'S WHAT I WANT TO HEAR.

00:05:10.109 --> 00:05:12.645
- I AM SO EXCITED.

00:05:12.678 --> 00:05:13.946
I AM SO EXCITED.

00:05:13.979 --> 00:05:15.147
- I KNOW IT'S A BIG ASS.

00:05:15.180 --> 00:05:18.517
- I'M SO, SO SCARED.
- I KNOW.

00:05:18.550 --> 00:05:20.720
I KNOW.

00:05:20.753 --> 00:05:22.755
I KNOW, I KNOW.

00:05:22.788 --> 00:05:26.025
