00:05:26.058 --> 00:05:28.728
- OKAY.

00:05:28.761 --> 00:05:31.797
- ARE YOU OKAY?

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.833
- I'M OKAY.
- OKAY.

00:05:37.703 --> 00:05:38.704
- HEY, GUYS.

00:05:38.737 --> 00:05:41.974
YOU KNOW MAYBE
AFTER A GAME VICTORY

00:05:42.007 --> 00:05:44.977
