00:05:45.010 --> 00:05:46.913
BOP, BA-BOP, BA-BOP,
BA-BOP, BA-BOP, BA-BOP.

00:05:49.381 --> 00:05:51.350
BA-BOP, BA-BOP, BA-BOP.

